- 2 taskset list tests require more than five CPUs; this runtime reports five.
- 1 sed performance test has an unconditional upstream SKIP=1.
- chattr j returns EPERM; chattr P returns EOPNOTSUPP on this filesystem.
- ifconfig requires dummy0: frozen runtime modprobe reports no dummy module
